   "Atlas/Rudvalis/CoordinateTwoRowRigidity.lean:3:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `theorem coordinateQuartet_two_row_direction_imp (p q c : Point) (hpq : p ≠ q)\n    (hpc : p ≠ c) (hqc : q ≠ c) (x y z t : E) (hxy : coordinateCross (p, x) ≠ coordinateCross (p, y))\n    (hQ : IsQuartet {coordinateCross (p, x), coordinateCross (p, y), coordinateCross (q, z), coordinateCross (q, t)})\n    (hdir : t + z = c.val ∨ t + z = c.val + q.val) : y + x = c.val ∨ y + x = c.val + p.val := by\n  classical\n  by_contra hn\n  push Not at hn\n  have ht : t = z + c.val ∨ t = z + c.val + q.val :=\n    by\n    rcases hdir with h | h\n    · left\n      calc\n        t = (t + z) + z := by rw [add_assoc, vector_add_self, add_zero]\n        _ = z + c.val := by rw [h, add_comm]\n    · right\n      calc\n        t = (t + z) + z := by rw [add_assoc, vector_add_self, add_zero]\n        _ = z + c.val + q.val := by rw [h]; abel\n  obtain ⟨w, hw, hpair, hz, ht⟩ := heavy_two_two_test p q c hpq hpc hqc x y z t hxy hn.1 hn.2 ht\n  apply\n    quartet_pair_test_obstruction _ hQ (coordinateCross (p, x)) (coordinateCross (p, y)) (coordinateCross (q, z))\n      (coordinateCross (q, t)) w (by simp) (by simp) ?_ hpair hz ht\n  · intro u hu hux huy\n    simp only [Set.mem_insert_iff, Set.mem_singleton_iff] at hu\n    rcases hu with h | h | h | h\n    · exact False.elim (hux h)\n    · exact False.elim (huy h)\n    · exact Or.inl h\n    · exact Or.inr h\n  · intro h\n    apply hw\n    simp only [Set.mem_insert_iff, Set.mem_singleton_iff] at h\n    rcases h with h | h | h | h <;> rw [h] <;> exact coordinateCross_mem _`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
