   "Atlas/Rudvalis/CoordinateTwoRowRigidity.lean:3:0: The module doc-string for a file should be the first command after the imports.\nPlease, add a module doc-string before `/-- The (2,2) row pattern forces the manuscript affine-plane directions. -/\ntheorem coordinateQuartet_two_row_rigidity (p q : Point) (hpq : p ≠ q) (x y z t : E)\n    (hxy : coordinateCross (p, x) ≠ coordinateCross (p, y)) (hzt : coordinateCross (q, z) ≠ coordinateCross (q, t))\n    (hQ : IsQuartet {coordinateCross (p, x), coordinateCross (p, y), coordinateCross (q, z), coordinateCross (q, t)}) :\n    (y + x = q.val ∨ y + x = q.val + p.val) ∧ (t + z = p.val ∨ t + z = p.val + q.val) :=\n  by\n  have hd := coordinateCross_difference_ne p x y hxy\n  have he := coordinateCross_difference_ne q z t hzt\n  apply two_row_direction_rigidity p q hpq (y + x) (t + z) hd.1 hd.2 he.1 he.2\n  intro c hpc hqc\n  constructor\n  · apply coordinateQuartet_two_row_direction_imp q p c hpq.symm hqc hpc z t x y hzt\n    have hs :\n      ({coordinateCross (q, z), coordinateCross (q, t), coordinateCross (p, x), coordinateCross (p, y)} :\n          Set MinimalCross) =\n        {coordinateCross (p, x), coordinateCross (p, y), coordinateCross (q, z), coordinateCross (q, t)} :=\n      by\n      ext v\n      simp only [Set.mem_insert_iff, Set.mem_singleton_iff]\n      tauto\n    rwa [hs]\n  · exact coordinateQuartet_two_row_direction_imp p q c hpq hpc hqc x y z t hxy hQ`.\n\nNote: This linter can be disabled with `set_option linter.style.header false`",
